01:04:58.392 --> 01:05:00.100
however, is that you
get information back

01:05:00.100 --> 01:05:02.020
about various levels of
lipids, and hormones,

01:05:02.020 --> 01:05:03.603
and metabolic
factors, et cetera.

01:05:03.603 --> 01:05:05.770
But you don't know what to
